---
description: Development workflow and TDD rules
alwaysApply: true
---

# Workflow
- Start with a short implementation plan.
- Write tests before implementation when practical.
- Make one logical change at a time.
- Run typecheck and tests after meaningful changes.
- Review diffs carefully before moving on.

# Agent workflow
- Ask for clarification if requirements are ambiguous.
- Prefer shared utilities and components.
- Do not rewrite working code unnecessarily.
- Keep outputs typed, minimal, and observable.
